OL,3,ASix killed in Krakow 'far-right'
OL,4,Ashooting, as three more bodies found in
OL,5,Aattacker's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 25-year-old Polish man - described
OL,8,Fby one minister as "ultra-nationalist"
OL,9,F- survived and is in custody.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
