OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK cannot 'cherry pick' EU single
OL,4,Amarket deal, Barnier tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Michel Barnier told the BBC's
OL,7,FSunday with Laura Kuenssberg that EU
OL,8,Fmembers would insist on the UK
OL,9,Freadopting certain conditions, such as
OL,10,Fthe free movement of people, to gain
OL,11,Faccess.
OL,13,FHe said there was not a "single market
OL,14,FC  la carte" menu from which the UK
OL,15,Fcould pick and choose what elements it
OL,16,Fwanted to adopt.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
