OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AVeterans shouldn't sleep rough this
OL,4,AChristmas, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will say that, going forward,
OL,7,Fnational and local government should
OL,8,Fwork under the "simple principle" that
OL,9,F"no one who has served our country
OL,10,Fshould ever be left to sleep rough on
OL,11,Four streets".
OL,13,FBurnham will ask local authorities to
OL,14,Fuse part of the additional #874m
OL,15,Falready announced to tackle
OL,16,Fhomelessness specifically for housing
OL,17,Fveterans.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
