OL,3,AWhat we know so far after Krakow gun
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least six people were killed and
OL,7,Fseveral others injured when a gunman
OL,8,Fsuspected to have ties to the far-right
OL,9,Fopened fire in central Krakow, the
OL,10,Fsecond largest city in Poland.
OL,12,FThree bodies were found at his home
OL,13,Fwhen it was searched by police. Here's
OL,14,Feverything we know so far.
OL,16,FThe attack began shortly before 15:00
OL,17,Flocal time (14:00 GMT) in Krakow's Main
OL,18,FMarket Square, the bustling central
OL,19,Fpoint of the city.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
