OL,3,AWhat we know so far after Krakow gun
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said a man drove into the square
OL,7,Fbefore beginning to fire "at random
OL,8,Fpeople from his car".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
