OL,3,ANo clear winner after tight New Zealand
OL,4,Ageneral election
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut opposition leader Chris Hipkins,
OL,7,Fwhose Labour Party won 36 seats, showed
OL,8,Fno signs of conceding, saying the
OL,9,F"shape of the next government" will
OL,10,Fremain uncertain "for a while".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
